## Process discipline (permanent)

- Deploy = push to main (GitHub Pages workflow). "Fix and deploy" means commit, push, watch the run, and verify live routes — do not stop at "uncommitted" and ask.
- The orchestrator may start/stop the dev server in the user's terminal tab when the user asks; never run `next build` while it is up.

